{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/cf9869f8d1f453467eb299a47b0548b8.avif?t=1770212225\" width=1200 height=240 /></span><strong>Princess of the Water Lilies</strong> is a 2D puzzle-platformer where players step into the paws of an adventurous cat, exploring a world filled with secrets and magic. Raised by a family of frogs in a tranquil pond, she is gifted a magical collar that becomes the key to unlocking her unique powers. By purring, the collar releases magical energy that transforms the environment\u2014causing plants to bloom, bridges to grow, and pathways to emerge\u2014allowing her to solve puzzles and traverse the mysterious world around her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/42c04a3f3b75abe708bab3f92e49f102.avif?t=1770212225\" width=1200 height=76 /></span>Use the cat's magical collar to manipulate the world, solving puzzles that range from environmental interactions to complex multi-stage challenges. Explore lush, hand-drawn biomes, each filled with obstacles, hidden pathways, and secrets to uncover.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/4fb3bc74c23702e46296d2188e3decaf.poster.avif?t=1770212225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/4fb3bc74c23702e46296d2188e3decaf.webm?t=1770212225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/621dd298d5827a20c479a1c9c9bfa5fa.avif?t=1770212225\" width=1200 height=76 /></span>As players progress, the magical collar unlocks new abilities that not only aid in puzzle-solving but also enhance the platforming experience, introducing mechanics like vine swinging, water traversal, and more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/cd6a6e822e4ac662ea38016e83d55629.poster.avif?t=1770212225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/cd6a6e822e4ac662ea38016e83d55629.webm?t=1770212225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/2b8e7b20a005abd4f70855a2b00e6a38.avif?t=1770212225\" width=1200 height=76 /></span>Featuring minimal text, the story is conveyed through beautifully illustrated emojis and universal icons, ensuring accessibility to players across all languages.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/36f65b9e84536b79708998adcb25759f.poster.avif?t=1770212225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/36f65b9e84536b79708998adcb25759f.webm?t=1770212225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/48784fca2268ac2a5f076fd9a3c70dc4.avif?t=1770212225\" width=1200 height=76 /></span>Encounter thrilling boss battles at the end of each chapter, where strategy and mastery of your abilities are essential to overcome the diverse foes.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/e30e5e8f506cbca114daf1504b805e97.poster.avif?t=1770212225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/e30e5e8f506cbca114daf1504b805e97.webm?t=1770212225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/b51d1c481a8a5e32283430a09b17dcbb.avif?t=1770212225\" width=1200 height=76 /></span>Every moment is brought to life through vibrant hand-drawn animations and an immersive orchestral soundtrack, providing a captivating experience that feels both nostalgic and fresh.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/c0ad9118322770a5a7c731467c51bc5e.poster.avif?t=1770212225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/c0ad9118322770a5a7c731467c51bc5e.webm?t=1770212225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/126bd8507ec32c2fc9ba031b42ff6d6a.avif?t=1770212225\" width=1200 height=76 /></span>With a visual style reminiscent of the golden age of animated classics, the game offers a heartwarming narrative that blends whimsical creatures, magical settings, and timeless adventure.<br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/43078c8ad4115fbf4a8132448f524049.poster.avif?t=1770212225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102340/extras/43078c8ad4115fbf4a8132448f524049.webm?t=1770212225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're solving intricate puzzles or navigating the picturesque landscapes, <strong>Princess of the Water Lilies</strong> offers a magical journey that will charm players of all ages.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Fire in the Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3102340/926a5ddff37659d90232af04e7c690fba1dec047.jpg"},{"name":"The Cobwebs in the Cave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3102340/e834ef5e7a3620068beb755c6b7a5d34d55f1020.jpg"},{"name":"The Piles in the Peaks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3102340/071e2674525d907a7a438d37d617051c7cc3d393.jpg"},{"name":"The Waste in the Waters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3102340/be0f318f7051ccbeda3091e2a0fee8e0a1ed6877.jpg"},{"name":"The Last Lap in the Lab","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3102340/d9f277ee7a9cdd15a4cb4312dd7e3d1773573b41.jpg"},{"name":"Hop In!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3102340/f8e261e6bb3c12cb225a412aa1b8c077947766c0.jpg"},{"name":"All Froggy Routes Connected!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3102340/91cc4dd0c58a766ce49f08b1d91e2d366d0e57d4.jpg"},{"name":"Chittering","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3102340/71320be9f335743a4f8ec460f9016256c9e0999d.jpg"},{"name":"Snuffling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.